    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore Missing Data -- Mysetery Records\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Explore how AI handles missing values when field labels are removed, and compare the results to what you saw in Level 1.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. Look at the Mystery Records dataset in `script.js`. Notice what's different about this dataset compared to the one in Level 1.\r\n2. Ask AI Tutor to fill in the missing values. Use a similar prompt to the one you wrote in Level 1.\r\n3. Record your observations and comparisons in `notes.md`.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
